<p>Baghdad’s heavily fortified Green Zone came under coordinated drone and rocket fire late Monday and early Tuesday, with attacks aimed at the US Embassy and the Royal Tulip Al Rasheed Hotel, according to Iraqi security sources and Iraq’s interior ministry. Iraq’s interior ministry said a drone hit the hotel without causing casualties or material damage. Security sources said air defenses engaged incoming threats near the embassy, and witnesses saw fire and a plume of smoke inside the compound. Several reports described the barrage as the most intense attack in Baghdad since the start of the current US-Israel war with Iran, a sign that the wider regional conflict is spilling further into Iraq. Even so, no casualties were reported at the hotel, and air defenses appear to have intercepted multiple incoming drones — one limited sign that Baghdad’s defenses and emergency response helped prevent a worse outcome.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/cWd9hozepyeppcohobsJTbHcHXcm-EnE6DCEaFSNJ7DVlDVa7VGnRMIcj0QVCoc-YoGKVHOID_HYv-3hfYKLaqhm_0l8PyQDhY_5dcdESR6f2PAdyXWGIpDTbaPkJwmMilNTwD-W3xMfyeghEqpiLUrsdJstg4O8EjEbqbdhSjvRoq2dBn0vn_CiaTOVifv1YEfdwlRbvRpUkGgvD22VSK6TZR6mmYjDWWpKNKE_JoFm5yNJ2fG1-TCITU02' alt='The Al-Rasheed Hotel in Baghdad&#x27;s Green Zone after a reported drone attack in Baghdad, Iraq, March 16, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Attack scale: Iraqi security sources told Reuters that rockets and at least five drones were launched toward the US Embassy from areas around Baghdad.</li><li>Embassy defenses: A Reuters witness cited by Al-Monitor said the embassy’s C-RAM air defense system shot down two drones as at least three more headed toward the compound.</li><li>Hotel damage: Le Monde reported that the drone strike on the Al-Rasheed hotel sparked a fire, though Iraqi authorities later said there were no injuries or material losses.</li><li>Broader spillover: SCMP reported that a separate strike on a house said to be hosting Iranian advisers killed four people, underscoring the wider security deterioration around Baghdad.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/16/baghdad-s-green-zone-targeted-in-drone-attack_6751503_4.html'>Baghdad&#x27;s Green Zone targeted in drone attack</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/iran-war-news-iranian-drones-target-us-embassy-hotel-in-baghdad-oilfield-also-attacked-11226043#publisher=newsstand'>Iranian Drones Target US Embassy, Hotel In Baghdad. Oilfield Also Attacked</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/drones-rockets-fired-at-us-embassy-in-baghdad-security-sources-say'>Drones, rockets fired at US Embassy in Baghdad, security sources say</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3346809/drone-strikes-luxury-hotel-baghdads-green-zone-home-us-embassy'>Drone and rocket attacks target US embassy as Iraq is pulled into war</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/drones-rockets-fired-us-embassy-baghdad-security-sources-say'>Drones, rockets fired at US embassy in Baghdad, security sources say</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/business/aerospace-defense/us-allies-rebuff-trumps-request-support-strait-hormuz-2026-03-16/'>The Royal Tulip Al Rasheed Hotel in the Green Zone in Baghdad is struck by a drone.</a> - reuters.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ynetnews.com/article/lizrds8gt'>The U.S. embassy in Baghdad is reportedly attacked by two suicide drones, causing a powerful explosion.</a> - ynetnews.com</li></ul>